<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"
      xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; }
    h2 { color: #1e293b; margin: 16px 0 6px 0; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>1. Legal_Register (40 Columns C01–C40 · Color-Coded Groups)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C01 (A) | Record ID / Mã bản ghi</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C02 (B) | Jurisdiction / Tài phán / Khu vực</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C03 (C) | Legal Domain / Lĩnh vực pháp luật</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C04 (D) | Legal Subdomain / Phân ngành pháp luật</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C05 (E) | Instrument Type / Loại văn bản</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C06 (F) | Document Number / Số hiệu / Mã đăng ký</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C07 (G) | Official Title / Tên gọi chính thức</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C08 (H) | Issuing Authority / Cơ quan ban hành / Lưu chiểu</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C09 (I) | Promulgation Date / Ngày ban hành / Ký</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C10 (J) | Effective Date / Ngày có hiệu lực / Áp dụng</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C11 (K) | Expiry / Termination / Ngày hết hiệu lực / Chấm dứt</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C12 (L) | Legal Status / Tình trạng hiệu lực</th><th style="background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C13 (M) | Amendment History / Lịch sử sửa đổi</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C14 (N) | Part / Chapter / Phần / Chương</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C15 (O) | Section / Mục / Tiểu mục</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C16 (P) | Article / Điều</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C17 (Q) | Clause / Khoản / Đoạn</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C18 (R) | Point / Điểm / Tiểu khoản</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C19 (S) | Source Page / Số trang nguồn</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C20 (T) | Source Line / Số dòng nguồn</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C21 (U) | Legal Subject / Chủ thể / Đối tượng pháp lý</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C22 (V) | Regulated Conduct / Hành vi bị điều chỉnh</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C23 (W) | Compliance Obligation / Tóm tắt nghĩa vụ tuân thủ</th><th style="background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C24 (X) | Official Source / Nguồn chính thức</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C25 (Y) | Legislative Purpose / Mục đích lập pháp / Điều ước</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C26 (Z) | Legal Principle / Nguyên tắc pháp lý</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C27 (AA) | Applicability / Điều kiện &amp; phạm vi áp dụng</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C28 (AB) | Regulated Entity / Chủ thể chịu ràng buộc</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C29 (AC) | Rights / Quyền được tạo lập / Bảo hộ</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C30 (AD) | Obligations / Nghĩa vụ tích cực</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C31 (AE) | Prohibitions / Nghĩa vụ tiêu cực / Điều cấm</th><th style="background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C32 (AF) | Exceptions / Ngoại lệ &amp; Bảo lưu</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C33 (AG) | Required Procedures / Thủ tục bắt buộc</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C34 (AH) | Required Documents / Hồ sơ / Tài liệu bắt buộc</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C35 (AI) | Time Constraints / Giới hạn thời gian / Thời hạn</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C36 (AJ) | Responsible Authority / Cơ quan có thẩm quyền</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C37 (AK) | Legal Consequences / Hậu quả pháp lý</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C38 (AL) | Evidence Requirements / Yêu cầu bằng chứng kiểm toán</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C39 (AM) | Cross-references / Dẫn chiếu chéo</th><th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;">C40 (AN) | Compliance Verification / Tiêu chí kiểm chứng tuân thủ</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-001</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Public international law</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UN system / foundational obligations</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Charter</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UN Charter (I-1)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Charter of the United Nations | Hiến chương Liên Hợp Quốc</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations; depositary functions assigned to the UN Secretary-General</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1945-06-26</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1945-10-24</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#e0f2fe;color:#0c4a6e;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; UN membership and treaty record must be checked for the relevant State | Đang có hiệu lực; cần kiểm tra tư cách thành viên LHQ và hồ sơ điều ước của từng quốc gia</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Amendments adopted in 1963, 1965 and 1973; verify consolidated text</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Chapters I, V, XVI</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 1, 2, 25, 102, 103</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online text not publisher-page-numbered</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbers; use Article anchor</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States, UN organs, international peace and security</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State conduct, UN membership, performance of Security Council decisions, treaty registration</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Primarily obligations of UN Member States; not a general direct private-company code</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/Pages/ViewDetails.aspx?chapter=1&amp;mtdsg_no=I-1&amp;src=TREATY</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Establish the UN framework for peace, security, cooperation and international relations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Sovereign equality, good-faith performance, peaceful settlement, prohibition on threat or use of force</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Interpret against membership, Charter text, UN organ decisions and applicable international law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States and UN organs</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Membership/participation rights and rights arising under the Charter framework</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Carry out applicable Charter obligations and relevant Security Council decisions</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Threat or use of force contrary to the Charter; non-performance of binding obligations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Charter-specific exceptions and Security Council framework; fact-specific legal analysis required</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Verify State membership, relevant UN decision and the applicable Charter provision</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty status record, ratification/accession records, UN resolutions and official notices</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Continuing obligations; specific decisions may set dates</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant State authorities; UN Security Council / General Assembly within their mandates</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International responsibility and Charter-based consequences; not a single universal private penalty</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Official UN resolutions, State instruments, official communications and implementation records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ICJ Statute; Security Council decisions; Article 102 treaty registration</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Confirm jurisdiction, applicable article, relevant UN decision and current official text</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-002</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Human rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Civil and political rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Covenant</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNTC IV-4; registration No. 14668</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights (ICCPR) | Công ước Quốc tế về các Quyền Dân sự và Chính trị (ICCPR)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1966-12-16</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1976-03-23 (Art. 41 procedure entered into force 1979-03-28)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 175 Parties per UNTC snapshot 2026-11-25 | Đang có hiệu lực; 175 Quốc gia thành viên theo bản ghi UNTC ngày 25/11/2026</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check Optional Protocols, reservations, declarations and later depositary notifications separately</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Part II, III</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 2, 4, 17, 19, 26</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant subparagraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online text not publisher-page-numbered</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbers</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Civil and political rights; State responsibility</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State measures affecting privacy, expression, equality, liberty and other protected rights</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties must respect and ensure Covenant rights and provide effective remedies within the Covenant framework</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/pages/ViewDetails.aspx?chapter=4&amp;mtdsg_no=IV-4&amp;src=IND</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Protect civil and political rights through binding international commitments</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Non-discrimination, legality, necessity, proportionality and effective remedy where applicable</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Only to the extent the relevant State is a Party; reservations and derogations must be checked</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties; public authorities</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Rights set out in the Covenant, subject to its terms</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Respect and ensure rights; adopt measures and remedies where required</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arbitrary or unlawful interference with protected rights; prohibited conduct depends on the article</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Permitted limitations and narrowly defined derogations under the Covenant; test each article</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Map each right to domestic constitutional/statutory law and responsible public authority</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Ratification record, reservations, domestic statutes, administrative records and remedy records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Continuing duties; reporting and remedy timelines arise under applicable mechanisms/domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State authorities; Human Rights Committee within its mandate</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International responsibility and domestic remedies or sanctions under implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Legislation, judicial decisions, policy records, impact assessments and remedy evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Optional Protocols; General Comments; related domestic constitutional and human-rights law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Confirm State party status, reservation, protected right, limitation test and domestic implementation</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-003</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Human rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Economic, social and cultural rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Covenant</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNTC IV-3; registration No. 14531</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International Covenant on Economic, Social and Cultural Rights (ICESCR) | Công ước Quốc tế về các Quyền Kinh tế, Xã hội và Văn hóa (ICESCR)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1966-12-16</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1976-01-03</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 174 Parties in the UNTC record reviewed 2026-11-25 | Đang có hiệu lực; 174 Quốc gia thành viên theo bản ghi UNTC rà soát ngày 25/11/2026</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check Optional Protocol and State-specific declarations separately</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Part II, III</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 2, 6, 7, 11, 12</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online text not publisher-page-numbered</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbers</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Work, fair conditions, adequate living standard, health and related rights</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State policy, legislation, access and progressive realization of protected rights</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties must take steps, using maximum available resources, toward realization of Covenant rights</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/pages/ViewDetails.aspx?chapter=4&amp;clang=_en&amp;mtdsg_no=IV-3&amp;src=TREATY</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Create binding commitments concerning economic, social and cultural rights</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Progressive realization, non-discrimination and minimum core obligations as interpreted by competent bodies</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State-party-specific; assess ratification, reservations, domestic law and the right in question</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties; public authorities</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Rights to work, just conditions, adequate standard of living and health, among others</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Take steps, ensure non-discrimination and report under applicable procedures</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Discriminatory denial or retrogressive measures inconsistent with applicable obligations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Resource-sensitive progressive realization; cannot be treated as a blanket exemption</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Map State obligations to domestic labour, health, education and social-protection law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Ratification record, budgets, statutes, policy decisions, service and outcome evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Progressive duties; specific domestic statutory deadlines vary</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State authorities; CESCR within its mandate</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International responsibility and domestic remedies under national law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Budgets, policy plans, service data, legislation and non-discrimination audits</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Optional Protocol; General Comments; ILO conventions; domestic labour and social law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check party status, reservations, available resources, non-discrimination and domestic enforceability</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-004</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Human rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Children's rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Convention</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNTC IV-11; registration No. 27531</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Convention on the Rights of the Child (CRC) | Công ước về Quyền Trẻ em (CRC)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1989-11-20</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1990-09-02</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 196 Parties in UNTC record reviewed 2026-11-24 | Đang có hiệu lực; 196 Bên tham gia theo bản ghi UNTC rà soát ngày 24/11/2026</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article 43(2) amendment and optional protocols; check State-specific participation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parts I–III</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 2, 3, 12, 19, 32</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online text not publisher-page-numbered</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbers</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Children and persons under 18 within the Convention definition</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Public decisions, child protection, participation, education and protection from exploitation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties must give effect to children's rights and protect children within the Convention framework</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/pages/ViewDetails.aspx?chapter=4&amp;clang=_en&amp;mtdsg_no=IV-11&amp;src=TREATY</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Recognize and protect the full range of children's rights</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Best interests of the child; non-discrimination; participation; survival and development</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State-party-specific; check age definition, reservations, protocols and domestic implementation</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties and public authorities; private actors through applicable domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Rights to protection, participation, development and other Convention rights</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Ensure rights, take protective measures and establish safeguards</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Conduct inconsistent with the applicable child-protection obligations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Convention-specific scope and permitted limitations; no general waiver of core protections</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Child-impact review, safeguarding procedures, reporting and referral according to domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Safeguarding policy, consent/assent records where lawful, incident records and training evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Continuing duties; domestic reporting and response deadlines apply</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State authorities; Committee on the Rights of the Child within its mandate</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Domestic administrative/civil/criminal consequences depend on implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Safeguarding records, risk assessments, training logs and incident-response records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Optional Protocols; ILO child-labour conventions; domestic child-protection law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check State party status, child definition, best-interests test, actor duties and local law</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-005</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Integrity / public governance</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Anti-corruption and private-sector integrity</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Convention</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNTC XVIII-14; registration No. 42146</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Convention against Corruption (UNCAC) | Công ước Liên Hợp Quốc chống Tham nhũng (UNCAC)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">2003-10-31</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">2005-12-14</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 193 Parties in UNTC record reviewed 2026-11-25 | Đang có hiệu lực; 193 Bên tham gia theo bản ghi UNTC rà soát ngày 25/11/2026</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check State-specific declarations and implementing legislation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Chapters II, III, IV</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 5, 9, 12, 15, 26</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online text not publisher-page-numbered</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbers</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Public-sector integrity, private-sector controls and international cooperation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Bribery, procurement, accounting, internal controls, corporate liability and cooperation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties implement preventive, criminalization, cooperation and asset-recovery measures; private entities may be affected by domestic implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/pages/viewdetails.aspx?chapter=18&amp;mtdsg_no=xviii-14&amp;src=treaty</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Prevent and combat corruption and strengthen international cooperation</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Integrity, transparency, accountability and effective prevention/enforcement</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State-party-specific; map Articles to domestic anti-corruption, procurement, company and criminal laws</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States Parties; public bodies; legal persons under domestic implementation</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Procedural and protection rights under applicable provisions and domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Implement preventive systems, criminalize specified conduct and cooperate as required</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Bribery and other offences as defined by the Convention and domestic implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article-specific elements, jurisdictional rules and domestic implementation vary</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Risk assessment, gifts/conflicts controls, third-party due diligence, books/records, reporting and investigations</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Policies, registers, approvals, accounting records, audit trails, training and investigation records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Ongoing controls; limitation periods and reporting windows depend on domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">National anti-corruption, prosecution, procurement and financial-intelligence authorities</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Domestic civil, administrative and criminal consequences; corporate liability where enacted</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Books and records, approval logs, audit findings, due-diligence files and remediation evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">OECD Anti-Bribery Convention; FATF standards; domestic company, procurement and criminal law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check treaty status, local offense definitions, corporate liability, territorial nexus and controls</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-006</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Maritime / environment</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Law of the sea</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Convention</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNTC XXI-6; registration No. 31363</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Convention on the Law of the Sea (UNCLOS) | Công ước Liên Hợp Quốc về Luật Biển (UNCLOS)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1982-12-10</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1994-11-16</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 172 Parties in UNTC record reviewed 2026-11-24 | Đang có hiệu lực; 172 Bên tham gia theo bản ghi UNTC rà soát ngày 24/11/2026</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Related implementing agreements, including the 1994 Part XI Agreement, must be checked independently</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parts V, XII, XVII</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant sections</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 56, 58, 192, 194, 308</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">PDF page numbering exists in official text; capture only after page-level inspection</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Use Article/paragraph; do not infer line number from PDF extraction</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Coastal States, flag States, ships, marine environment and maritime activities</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Maritime zones, jurisdiction, navigation, resource use and marine environmental protection</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State obligations and jurisdictional rules; private operators are generally reached through flag/coastal State domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://treaties.un.org/Pages/ViewDetailsIII.aspx?chapter=21&amp;mtdsg_no=XXI-6&amp;src=IND</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Establish a comprehensive legal order for the oceans and seas</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Due regard, peaceful uses, sovereign rights, cooperation and protection of marine environment</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Party status, maritime zone, flag/coastal State jurisdiction and related implementing agreements matter</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States; flag/coastal State authorities; ships and operators through applicable law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Navigation and other rights allocated by maritime zone and treaty text</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Protect and preserve marine environment; exercise jurisdiction consistently with UNCLOS</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Conduct inconsistent with duties and limitations in the relevant maritime zone</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Zone-specific rights, exceptions and special regimes; interpret text and related instruments</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Map voyage/operation to maritime zone, flag, port and coastal-state rules</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Vessel records, permits, voyage logs, environmental monitoring and incident records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Continuing duties; incident and reporting deadlines depend on domestic/sector rules</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Coastal State, flag State, port State and competent international bodies</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State responsibility and domestic civil/administrative/criminal consequences</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Vessel, voyage, permit, monitoring, inspection and incident evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1994 Part XI Agreement; domestic maritime and environmental law; IMO instruments</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Determine zone, vessel/flag, activity, party status and local implementation</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-007</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Commercial / private law</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International sale of goods</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Convention</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">CISG (Vienna, 1980)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods | Công ước Viên về Hợp đồng Mua bán Hàng hóa Quốc tế (CISG)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations / UNCITRAL</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1980-04-11</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1988-01-01 (general entry into force; State-specific dates differ)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#e0f2fe;color:#0c4a6e;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force for Contracting States; verify party status and entry date for each relevant State | Có hiệu lực đối với các Quốc gia thành viên ký kết; xác minh tư cách và ngày hiệu lực từng quốc gia</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check declarations/reservations, including Articles 92–96, and State-specific entry dates</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parts I–IV</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 1, 6, 11, 35, 38, 39, 53, 99</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – HTML treaty page</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbering</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Buyers and sellers in international sale-of-goods contracts</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Formation, delivery, conformity, payment, examination and notice</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contracting parties must perform sale obligations if CISG applies, subject to the Convention and party autonomy</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/salegoods/conventions/sale_of_goods/cisg/status</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Provide uniform rules for international sale-of-goods contracts</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Uniformity, good faith in international trade interpretation and party autonomy</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article 1 tests; place-of-business and State status; private international law route; exclusions and reservations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Commercial parties to covered international sales</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contractual rights and remedies under the CISG</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Seller delivery/conformity duties; buyer payment/taking-delivery duties</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No freestanding general prohibition; contractual breach triggers CISG remedies</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article 2 exclusions, Article 6 exclusion/variation and State declarations</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check governing law, CISG applicability, contract terms, delivery, examination and notice</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Executed contract, order, invoice, shipping, inspection and notice records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Articles 38–39 notice timing; contract and applicable limitation periods</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Courts and arbitral tribunals applying the Convention</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contract remedies including performance, avoidance and damages where requirements are met</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contract, shipment, inspection, acceptance, notices and payment evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Private international law; Incoterms (contractual rules, not legislation); domestic limitation law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Run Article 1/6 applicability test before using CISG default rules</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-008</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Dispute resolution</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Recognition/enforcement of foreign arbitral awards</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Convention</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">New York Convention 1958; UNTS No. 4739</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Convention on the Recognition and Enforcement of Foreign Arbitral Awards | Công ước New York 1958 về Công nhận và Thi hành Phán quyết Trọng tài Nước ngoài</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">United Nations Secretary-General (depositary); UNCITRAL support</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1958-06-10</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1959-06-07</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#e0f2fe;color:#0c4a6e;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force for Contracting States; check State-specific reservations and implementation | Có hiệu lực đối với các Quốc gia thành viên ký kết; kiểm tra bảo lưu và pháp luật thực thi trong nước</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check reciprocity/commercial reservations and domestic arbitration legislation</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. I, II, III, IV, V, VII, XII</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – HTML/PDF source</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – use Article locator; no stable line numbering</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Courts, arbitration parties and foreign/non-domestic awards</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arbitration agreements, recognition and enforcement of arbitral awards</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contracting States must recognize arbitration agreements and enforce covered awards subject to Convention conditions</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://uncitral.un.org/en/texts/arbitration/conventions/foreign_arbitral_awards</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Reduce discrimination against foreign arbitral awards and facilitate cross-border enforcement</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Recognition/enforcement with limited refusal grounds</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check State party status, territorial/commercial reservations and whether award falls within Article I</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Contracting States and their courts; contracting parties indirectly through domestic procedure</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Right to seek recognition/enforcement or invoke limited refusal grounds</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Courts must apply Convention obligations within domestic procedural law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Refusal outside the Convention's permitted grounds is constrained</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article V grounds; Article I reservations; Article VII more-favourable-right provision</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Validate arbitration clause, award, competent court, certified documents and translation</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arbitration agreement, original/certified award, translations and service evidence</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Domestic limitation and procedural deadlines apply</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Competent courts in State where recognition/enforcement is sought</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Recognition/enforcement, or refusal where Article V grounds are established</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Award, arbitration agreement, service, due-process and jurisdiction records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Domestic arbitration act; procedural code; applicable institutional rules</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check State party/reservation, Article I scope, Article IV documents and Article V grounds</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-009</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / WTO</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Trade / customs</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">WTO institutional and multilateral trade framework</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty / Agreement</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Marrakesh Agreement (1994)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Marrakesh Agreement Establishing the World Trade Organization | Hiệp định Marrakesh thành lập Tổ chức Thương mại Thế giới (WTO)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">World Trade Organization</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1994-04-15</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">1995-01-01</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#e0f2fe;color:#0c4a6e;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; amendment and membership status must be checked | Đang có hiệu lực; cần kiểm tra tình trạng sửa đổi và tư cách thành viên</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Amended/rectified; WTO legal-text compilation includes amendments and additions through Sep 2025; Fisheries Subsidies Agreement effective 2025-09-15</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Main Agreement and Annexes</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. II, XI, XII, XIII, XIV, XVI; Annexes 1–3</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – online HTML text</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';