;">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; 194 Parties per UNFCCC status page reviewed 2026-11-25 (page reports current data as of 2026-01-27) | Đang có hiệu lực; 194 Bên tham gia theo trang UNFCCC rà soát ngày 25/11/2026 (dữ liệu hiển thị đến 27/01/2026)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Decisions/rules under the Convention and Agreement; check current CMA decisions and national NDCs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">—</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 2, 4, 7, 13, 21</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">As applicable</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Official text includes document page numbering</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Use Article/paragraph; no stable line number assigned</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parties to the UNFCCC/Paris Agreement; climate policy and reporting</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Nationally determined contributions, mitigation, adaptation, transparency and reporting</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parties prepare, communicate and maintain successive NDCs and pursue domestic mitigation measures under Article 4</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://unfccc.int/process/the-paris-agreement/status-of-ratification</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Strengthen global response to climate change and temperature goals</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Equity, common but differentiated responsibilities and respective capabilities</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Party-specific; NDC, reporting framework, national laws and sector-specific rules determine practical obligations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Parties/States; businesses indirectly through domestic climate, energy, reporting and product rules</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Climate finance/support provisions and participatory mechanisms within applicable rules</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Prepare/maintain NDCs; reporting and transparency obligations under applicable framework</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No generic direct company prohibition in the Agreement; domestic measures must be checked</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Differentiation, flexibility and support mechanisms within the treaty framework</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Map entity activity to domestic GHG, energy, environmental and disclosure rules</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Emissions inventory, energy data, methodology, assurance and regulatory filings</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">NDC cycles and transparency reporting cycles; domestic reporting deadlines vary</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">National climate/environment ministries; UNFCCC bodies</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Primarily State-level international obligations; business sanctions arise under domestic implementation</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Verified emissions data, source factors, activity records, assurance statements and submissions</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">UNFCCC; Kyoto Protocol; CMA decisions; domestic climate and energy law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check State participation, current NDC, sector rules, reporting framework and national implementation</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">INT-012</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International / ILO</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Labour / occupational safety</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Fundamental labour principles and rights</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty family / conventions and protocol</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ILO fundamental instruments (11 instruments; see NORMLEX)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ILO Fundamental Conventions and Protocol | Các Công ước và Nghị định thư Cơ bản của ILO</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">International Labour Organization</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Various: 1930–2006; P029 adopted 2014</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Convention-specific; varies by instrument and ratifying State</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Treaty-by-treaty and State-by-State; not one single legal status | Theo từng công ước và từng quốc gia phê chuẩn; không có một tình trạng hiệu lực duy nhất</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ILO Declaration on Fundamental Principles and Rights at Work amended in 2022 to include safe and healthy working environment</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Examples: C087 Art. 2; C155 Art. 4; C182 Art. 3</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – NORMLEX database</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – no stable statutory line numbering</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Workers, employers, trade unions and States</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Freedom of association, collective bargaining, forced labour, discrimination, child labour and occupational safety</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States are bound by conventions they ratify; employers are reached through applicable national labour law and collective agreements</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://normlex.ilo.org/dyn/nrmlx_en/f?p=NORMLEXPUB:12200:0::NO:::</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Set fundamental international labour principles and rights</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Freedom, equality, dignity, safety and collective representation</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Ratification status must be checked individually for each convention and State</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">States; employers and workers through applicable domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Freedom of association, equality, safe work and protection rights under applicable instruments</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Implement ratified conventions; employers comply with local labour law and collective agreements</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Conduct contrary to applicable fundamental labour protections and implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific scope, definitions and permitted exceptions</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check national law and employer practice for relevant labour, OSH and child-labour safeguards</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Union registration, consultation, labour-inspection, OSH risk assessments, training and supplier audit records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Instrument-specific and domestic statutory/inspection timelines</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">National labour/inspection authorities and ILO supervisory bodies</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">State responsibility and domestic administrative, civil, criminal or remedial consequences</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Registration/consultation records, OSH risk assessments, training logs, age checks and supplier audits</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ILO conventions and protocol; national labour and occupational safety legislation</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Verify ratification per convention and State, domestic law and workplace controls</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">EU-001</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">European Union</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Data protection</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Personal data processing, security and transfers</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Regulation</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Regulation (EU) 2016/679</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) | Quy định Chung về Bảo vệ Dữ liệu (GDPR — Regulation (EU) 2016/679)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">European Parliament and Council of the European Union</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">2016-04-27</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">2018-05-25 application date</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force / applicable from 2018-05-25 | Đang có hiệu lực / áp dụng từ 25/05/2018; kiểm tra sửa đổi sau đó và luật bổ sung của Quốc gia thành viên</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Check subsequent amendments and Member State supplementary law</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Chapters I–IX</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Per Regulation structure</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 3, 5, 6, 24–25, 28, 30, 32–33, 44, 99</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant subparagraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – EU Official Journal / EUR-Lex</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – use Article/paragraph/point</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Personal data and data subjects</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Collection, storage, use, disclosure, security and international transfer of personal data</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Controllers and processors must comply with processing principles, lawful basis, security, accountability, processor contracts and transfer rules</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/oj</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Protect fundamental rights regarding personal data and enable free data flow within the EU</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Lawfulness, fairness, transparency, purpose limitation, data minimization, accuracy, storage limitation, integrity/confidentiality and accountability</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Article 3 territorial scope: EU establishment, offering goods/services to persons in EU, or monitoring behaviour in EU</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Controllers and processors</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Data subject rights and regulatory rights under GDPR</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Lawful processing, principles, design/default protection, DPA, ROPA, security, breach notice and Chapter V transfer safeguards</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Unlawful or unauthorized personal-data processing and non-compliant transfers</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Specific exemptions/derogations and Member State rules where permitted</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Run Art. 3 scope test, maintain data inventory &amp; lawful basis, execute DPAs, manage breaches and assess transfers</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Data-flow map, lawful-basis record, DPA, subprocessor list, ROPA, security assessments and breach logs</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Applicable from 2018-05-25; 72-hour breach notice to authority under Art. 33 where triggered</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">EU Supervisory Authorities and European Data Protection Board (EDPB)</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Administrative fines and remedies under applicable GDPR provisions and Member State law (fact- and provision-specific)</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">ROPA, DPAs, transfer assessments, security logs and breach notification records</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">GDPR articles, EDPB guidelines and Member State supplementary data-protection law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Test Art. 3 scope, verify governance/security/transfer records and check statutory timelines</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#1e3a8a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">EU-002</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">European Union</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Technology / AI governance</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Risk classification, transparency, governance and phased application</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Regulation</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Artificial Intelligence Act (EU AI Act) | Đạo luật Trí tuệ Nhân tạo của Liên minh Châu Âu (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">European Parliament and Council of the European Union</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">2024-06-13</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force 2024-08-01; phased application under Art. 113</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">No expiry date shown</td><td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#78350f;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">In force; phased application per Art. 113 (consolidated text 2026-07-27 shows general application 2026-08-02 with exceptions/phases) | Có hiệu lực từ 01/08/2024; áp dụng theo từng giai đoạn theo Điều 113 (bản hợp nhất 27/07/2026 ghi nhận mốc chung 02/08/2026 kèm ngoại lệ/lộ trình)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Current consolidated version dated 2026-07-27; recheck consolidated text and Art. 113 dates</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Chapters I–XIII &amp; Annexes</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Per Regulation structure</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Arts. 2, 4, 5, 6, 9–11, 13–14, 16, 26, 50, 99, 113</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant paragraphs</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Relevant subparagraphs/Annexes</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – EU Official Journal / EUR-Lex</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">N/A – use Article/paragraph/Annex</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">AI systems, AI models and AI value-chain operators</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Development, placing on market, deployment, risk management, transparency and oversight of AI</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Identify role, screen prohibited AI practices, classify risk tier and fulfill obligations according to Art. 113 dates</td><td style="background-color:#f0fdfa;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/2026-07-27</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Promote trustworthy human-centric AI while protecting health, safety, fundamental rights and internal market</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Safety, transparency, human oversight, data governance and risk-based proportionality</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Scope and extraterritorial reach under Art. 2; role-based and date-phased applicability</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Providers, deployers and other operators as defined</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Rights and remedies/mechanisms under the Regulation</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">AI literacy (Art. 4), high-risk risk/data/technical files (Arts. 9–11), oversight/instructions (Arts. 13–14), provider/deployer duties (Arts. 16, 26) and transparency (Art. 50)</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Prohibited AI practices under Art. 5 and non-compliant high-risk/transparency operations</td><td style="background-color:#fffbeb;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Exclusions, exceptions and phased application dates under Arts. 2, 6, Annexes I/III and Art. 113</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Map role (provider/deployer), screen Art. 5, classify under Art. 6 &amp; Annexes I/III, track Art. 113 calendar and implement controls</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Use-case register, classification memo, risk/data/technical documentation, instructions, oversight logs and transparency notices</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Art. 113 phases: 2024-08-01 in force; 2025-02-02 Ch. I–II (exceptions); 2025-08-02 additional duties; 2026-08-02 general application; 2026-12-02 additional Art. 5; 2027-12-02 Annex III high-risk; 2028-08-02 Annex I high-risk</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Market surveillance / competent national authorities and EU AI governance bodies</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Penalties under Art. 99 tied to specific infringement and current fine tier (do not infer one universal fine)</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Assessment files, technical documentation, marking/oversight logs and Art. 113 timeline register</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">AI Act provisions, Annexes I and III, and related Union/national product or sectoral law</td><td style="background-color:#f5f3ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;mso-number-format:'\@';">Verify actor role, applicable article, Art. 113 effective date and control evidence</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>

