p;mtdsg_no=xviii-14&amp;src=treaty</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#ccfbf1;color:#115e59;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">PM-0002</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">6</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">INT-005</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Art. 9</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Public procurement and public finance</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Mua sắm công và tài chính công</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">State Parties</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Public procurement/public finance</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Establish appropriate systems based on transparency, competition and objective criteria</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Thiết lập hệ thống minh bạch, cạnh tranh và tiêu chí khách quan</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Procurement rules, bid files, audit trails</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">2005-12-14</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://treaties.un.org/pages/viewdetails.aspx?chapter=18&amp;mtdsg_no=xviii-14&amp;src=treaty</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#ccfbf1;color:#115e59;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">PM-0003</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">6</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">INT-005</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Art. 12</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Private-sector prevention</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Phòng ngừa tham nhũng khu vực tư</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">State Parties; private entities through domestic law</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Commercial accounting, audit and corporate governance</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Promote accounting/auditing standards and measures against corruption in private sector</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Thúc đẩy chuẩn mực kế toán/kiểm toán và kiểm soát chống tham nhũng khu vực tư</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Books, controls, audit, conflict registers and due diligence</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">2005-12-14</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://treaties.un.org/pages/viewdetails.aspx?chapter=18&amp;mtdsg_no=xviii-14&amp;src=treaty</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#ccfbf1;color:#115e59;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">PM-0004</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">6</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">INT-005</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">International / UN</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Art. 15</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Bribery of national public officials</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Hối lộ công chức quốc gia</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">State Parties; persons under implementing law</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Giving/offering or soliciting/accepting undue advantage</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Check local criminal-law elements and controls; Convention requires State criminalization</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Kiểm tra yếu tố cấu thành theo luật địa phương và kiểm soát nội bộ</td><td style="background-color:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Gifts/entertainment register, approvals, payment records</td><td style="background-color:#f