:top;">Canada — Liên bang</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Justice Laws Website</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Department of Justice Canada</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Consolidated federal Acts, regulations, annual statutes and prior versions</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Official consolidated federal legislation</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://laws.justice.gc.ca/eng/</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Site showed consolidations generally current to 2026-10-29</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Provincial/territorial statutes and regulations must also be checked</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">SRC-011</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Australia — Commonwealth</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Úc — Liên bang (Commonwealth)</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Federal Register of Legislation</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Office of Parliamentary Counsel</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Acts, legislative instruments, notifiable instruments, lifecycle and historical versions</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Authorised whole-of-government Commonwealth legislation register</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://www.legislation.gov.au/</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Dynamic; all/in-force/not-in-force filters available</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">State and territory laws are separate layers</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">SRC-012</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">India</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Ấn Độ</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">India Code</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Government of India / Ministry departments; NIC platform</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Central Acts, sections and subordinate legislation</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Government legislation database</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://www.indiacode.nic.in/indiacode/home.jsp</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Dynamic; verify enactment and Gazette publication</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">State legislation and notifications may be separately applicable</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">SRC-013</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">South Africa</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Nam Phi</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">South African Government — Acts</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Government of South Africa</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Acts, Constitution, notices and proclamations</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Official government acts directory</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://www.gov.za/documents/acts</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Dynamic listing</td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Check Government Gazette and commencement proclamation for effective date</td></tr><tr><td style="background-color:#dbeafe;color:#1e40af;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">SRC-014</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Viet Nam</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Việt Nam</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Cơ sở dữ liệu quốc gia về văn bản pháp luật (VBPL)</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Vietnamese state legal-document database</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Laws, codes, decrees, circulars and status records</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">National legal-document database; verify official Gazette/publication where needed</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">https://vbpl.vn/</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Dynamic</td><td style="background-color:#eff6ff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;">Check current consolidated text, amendments, effective date and local/sector rules</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>4. Compliance_Controls (17 Quality Gates)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Gate ID</th>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Check (EN / VI)</th>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Pass Criteria</th>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Evidence</th>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Fail Rule</th>
        <th style="background-color:#6d28d9;color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px;">Severity</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-01</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Jurisdiction resolved / Xác định tài phán</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Country, territory, state/province and supranational regime identified</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Scope sheet and entity/activity map</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Do not mark applicable until jurisdiction is explicit</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-02</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Actor and role resolved / Xác định chủ thể &amp; vai trò</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Natural/legal person and role (provider, controller, employer, seller, importer, etc.) identified</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Entity profile and role decision memo</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Split the record by legal role</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-03</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Territorial nexus tested / Kiểm tra mối liên hệ lãnh thổ</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Place of establishment, conduct, target market, persons, assets and effects mapped</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Territorial-scope memo</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Re-run for each market and data flow</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-04</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Treaty party status checked / Kiểm tra tư cách điều ước</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Ratification/accession, State-specific effective date, reservations and declarations checked</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Depositary status record</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Do not apply treaty as a party obligation without status check</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-05</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Hierarchy/type verified / Xác minh thứ bậc &amp; loại văn bản</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Binding treaty/statute/regulation distinguished from model law, recommendation, standard or guidance</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Source classification</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Reclassify soft law; identify enactment instrument if binding force is claimed</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-06</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Primary text captured / Thu thập văn bản nguồn gốc</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Official source or authoritative gazette identified; version/date recorded</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Source URL, file hash or archived copy</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Replace secondary summary with primary text</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-07</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Amendment history reviewed / Rà soát lịch sử sửa đổi</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">All amendments, commencement provisions, repeal and replacement checked</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Version diff and amending acts</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Suspend affected control until current text confirmed</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-08</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Effective-date phase reviewed / Rà soát lộ trình hiệu lực</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Commencement, application, transitional and deferred provisions mapped by Article</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Effective-date calendar</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Do not assume whole instrument applies at once</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-09</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Provision located / Định vị chính xác điều khoản</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Part/Chapter/Section/Article/Clause/Point recorded</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Legal locator</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">No record without precise locator</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-10</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Line/page handled correctly / Xử lý số trang &amp; dòng chuẩn</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Published page/line captured only if stable and actually present; otherwise explicitly N/A</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Source locator note</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Never invent line/page numbers; use Article locator</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-11</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Applicability test documented / Lập hồ sơ phép thử áp dụng</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Conditions, thresholds, exclusions and scope criteria recorded</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Applicability memo</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Escalate ambiguous scope to local counsel</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-12</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Obligation operationalized / Chuyển hóa nghĩa vụ thành kiểm soát</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Obligation, owner, action, deadline, procedure and evidence defined</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Control description and RACI</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Convert vague statement into testable control</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-13</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Penalty and remedy verified / Kiểm chứng chế tài &amp; khắc phục</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Penalty/restitution/remedy tied to exact provision and current version</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Official penalty provision and legal analysis</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Do not infer penalty from a general law title</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-14</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Subnational law checked / Kiểm tra luật địa phương/ngành</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">State/province/municipality/sector regulator rules reviewed where relevant</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Local-law register</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Mark jurisdiction coverage incomplete until resolved</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-15</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Audit evidence retained / Lưu giữ bằng chứng kiểm toán</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Evidence source, owner, retention period and test frequency defined</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Evidence register and audit trail</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Create evidence plan before claiming compliance</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-16</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Change monitoring active / Giám sát thay đổi pháp lý</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Official gazette, regulator, court and treaty depositary updates monitored</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Change log and review date</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Reassess impacted controls after each change</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High</td>
        </tr><tr>
          <td style="background-color:#ede9fe;color:#5b21b6;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">CC-17</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Legal review gate passed / Qua rà soát chuyên môn pháp lý</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">High-risk or ambiguous issues reviewed by qualified lawyer in relevant jurisdiction</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Review memo / approval</td>
          <td style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Mark REQUIRES-LEGAL-REVIEW; do not self-certify</td>
          <td style="background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-weight:bold;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:6px;">Critical</td>
        </tr></tbody>
  </table>
</body>
</html>